From 3cf4e6522aa0a7ab12b85dde6111609887e6c70d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ga=C3=ABl=20Duval?= <gael@murena.io>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 15:42:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] perf(nginx): cache the versioned api.js like the other
 static files [upstreamable]

The no-store rule for api.js also matched its versioned URL
(/<version>-<hash>/web-apps/apps/api/documents/api.js), which the editor
frame loads on every open: one uncacheable request (63 KB, 13 KB
compressed) per document opened, on the editor start-up path. Only the
unversioned URL, which integrators load and which carries the version
path, must stay uncached; the versioned one changes with the hash.

Checked on an own instance: versioned api.js now answers
"Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable" and is served from
the browser cache on warm opens (it was refetched each time); the
unversioned URL is still no-store. No measurable time change on
localhost (one round trip saved per open on a real network).

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../documentserver/nginx/includes/ds-docservice.conf.m4   | 8 +++++---
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/common/documentserver/nginx/includes/ds-docservice.conf.m4 b/common/documentserver/nginx/includes/ds-docservice.conf.m4
index 3c2659d..77a80db 100644
--- a/common/documentserver/nginx/includes/ds-docservice.conf.m4
+++ b/common/documentserver/nginx/includes/ds-docservice.conf.m4
@@ -6,12 +6,14 @@ location ~ ^(?<cache>\/web-apps\/apps\/(?!api\/documents\/api\.js$).*)$ {
   return 302 $the_scheme://$the_host$the_prefix/M4_PRODUCT_VERSION-$cache_tag$cache$is_args$args;
 }
 
-#disable caching for api.js
-location ~ ^(\/[\d]+\.[\d]+\.[\d]+[\.|-][\w]+)?\/(web-apps\/apps\/api\/documents\/api\.js)$ {
+#disable caching for api.js (the unversioned URL that integrators load: it carries the
+#version path of everything else; the versioned copy that the editor frame loads is
+#immutable like the other static files)
+location ~ ^\/(web-apps\/apps\/api\/documents\/api\.js)$ {
   expires off;
   add_header Cache-Control "no-store, no-cache, must-revalidate";
   # gzip_static on;
-  alias  M4_DS_ROOT/$2;
+  alias  M4_DS_ROOT/$1;
 }
 
 location ~ ^(\/[\d]+\.[\d]+\.[\d]+[\.|-][\w]+)?\/(document_editor_service_worker.js)$ {
